---
real_var: INTERPOLATED
label: Status
---

@import "../lib/formatting.mds" as fmt

Single braces are literal text (no interpolation): {not_a_var}

Double braces interpolate a variable: {{real_var}}

Escape sequence \{{ prevents interpolation: rendered as \{{ in the output.

Mixed line: {literal_text} then {{real_var}} then {another_literal}

Function calls use double braces: {{fmt.bold(real_var)}}

Single-brace function syntax is literal text: {fmt.bold("nope")}

Template syntax guide: use \{{ for a literal \{{ and {{label}} for injected values.
